Description: Offline audiobook player for KDE Plasma
 Audium is a desktop audiobook player for the books you already have on
 disk. It works entirely offline: no accounts, no cloud, no online lookups,
 no telemetry. It only reads your library and never changes, moves, renames
 or deletes your audio files.
